sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Person as Person
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Person: reactivate()
    Note over Person: Policies: personRead, personWrite, personExecute
    Note over Person: Guards (2)
    Person->>Person: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;inactive#quot;
    Person->>Person: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Person->>Person: mutate.status
    Person->>EventBus: emit PersonReactivated on person.reactivated
    Person-->>-Client: void